# Legacy scripts preserved locally, not committed.
scripts/archive/
# NOTE: `docs/archive/` is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the repository's
# audit trail — `docs/README.md` links to `docs/archive/README.md` and 11
# archived plans are already tracked. Ignoring the directory meant any newly
# archived document became untracked *and* invisible to `git status`, so moving
# a file in silently deleted it from the repository and left the committed
# `docs/README.md` pointing at a file that a fresh clone does not have.
# `scripts/check_docs_links.py` now fails when a link target is not tracked.

# Build output artifacts (packaging)
packaging/usage/dotnet/tests/obj/

# Abandoned AI-tool local state (mirrors existing .agentvault/ / .aza/ ignores)
.trae/
.forge/
.wpscomate/

# Alternate cargo target dir used when the default target/ is unavailable
/.cargo-target*/
